  "answer 1. I hold three seal-stones (Blackrose, Gemin, Vorannuhl) for the kings' gate at drowned Teku-Sul Spire off Lilmoth. I must keep them from anyone, such as the rival Collector Ennodius Vanin, reaching the gate first. 2. Bring the three stones to Never-Writes-Twice at the back of Nesh-Deeka's House in Helstrom. 3. I can simply hand them over, or talk to her first to ask my open questions. I do not see another choice yet. 4. I do not understand why the Unbound seal trees, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar or where its key is, or how Nesh-Deeka knows of the Unbound. I could ask Never-Writes-Twice.",
